      "role": "user",
      "content": "that sounds like a good start. for the spectrum activity, can you give me some specific examples of what those regressive or stubborn viewpoints might look like in a modern context? i want my kids to see the actual arguments so they get why those groups are often seen as standing in the way of progress.",
