      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for those examples. so, for the lesson plan, i want to make sure the students really grasp the moral difference between the two. how should i frame the part about the 'regressive' side so they understand it's not just about liking tradition, but about actively being an obstacle to necessary societal evolution?",
